---
import LogoCanvas from "./LogoCanvas.astro";
---

<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-start mb-12">
  <div class="logo-wrapper">
    <div class="logo-bg"></div>
    <LogoCanvas />
  </div>
  <h1 class="text-7xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-bold text-center display-text">UYUPUN</h1>
  <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-center mb-8 display-text">xuxyu ... PUNPO PUNPO Technologies, Org.</p>
  <p class="text-left max-w-2xl leading-relaxed"><span class="text-bg">──&ensp;創ることへの純粋な愉しさを原動力に、エンタメとアートの境界で活動中。あらゆる領域をミックスし、伝統と最新技術を融合したルネサンス的作品を数多く制作する、少人数精鋭のキメラ的クリエイティブ集団。あ、もしもし？ぅゅだけど...うん、そうぷんぽぷんぽ(´･ェ･｀)</span></p>
  <p class="text-left max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mt-4"><span class="text-bg">──&ensp;Driven by a pure love of making things, we operate at the intersection of entertainment and art. A small but fierce chimeric creative collective that blends every discipline to craft a wealth of Renaissance-style works fusing tradition with cutting-edge technology. Oh, hello? It's uyu... yeah, punpo punpo (´･ェ･｀)</span></p>
</div>

<style>
  .logo-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: min(700px, calc(100vw - 2rem));

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      width: min(700px, calc(100vw - 4rem));
    }
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .logo-bg {
    position: absolute;
    width: min(400px, 57%);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    background: black;
  }

  .text-bg {
    color: white;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    padding: 0 0.3em;
    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;
    box-decoration-break: clone;
  }
</style>
